    "title": "D.C. Mayor Responds to National Guard Deployment",
    "text": "• D.C. Mayor Muriel Bowser criticized President Donald Trump's deployment of National Guard troops in Washington, D.C.\n• Bowser described Trump's actions as 'unsettling and unprecedented.'\n• She characterized the deployment as part of an 'authoritarian push.'\n• Trump activated 800 members of the National Guard to assist in crime control efforts in the city.",
